OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells during the evening.
OL,7,FCloud will spread east from midnight
OL,8,Fwith outbreaks of rain following by
OL,9,Fthe morning. The winds will also
OL,10,Ffreshen towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain, some heavy, and accompanied by
OL,14,Fstrong southerly winds. The winds turn
OL,15,Fwesterly with severe gale in the
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
