OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FStorm
OL,6,FBoelo will bring severe gales and
OL,7,Fheavy showers Sunday, these easing in
OL,8,Fafternoon. Dry and bright start Monday
OL,9,Fthen wet and windy. Very windy with
OL,10,Fshowers, some heavy, Tuesday.
